             Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />

Some of the information required to have your ASU ID mailed is missing. Please email <a href="mailto:sundevilcardinfo@asu.edu" target="_blank">
 sundevilcardinfo@asu.edu</a> and include <b>ALL</b> of the following information in the email to have your card mailed.<br /><br />

<ol>
  <li>Use the word <i><u>“Orientation”</i></u> as the subject of your email.</li> 
  <li>Include your <i><u>ASU ID number</i></u> in the body of the email.</li> 
  <li>Include the <i><u>mailing address</i></u> you want your card mailed to in the body of the email. </li> 
  <li>You will need to attach a valid, current <i><u>photo ID</i></u> as proof of identity.  <i>Acceptable forms of ID are: US drivers license, state issued ID card, US passport, or US Visa.</i></li> <br />
</ol>

After we have processed your request, we will send you a confirmation email. You should receive your ASU ID in the mail within 10 business days.<br /><br />
    
Regards, <br />

 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
